N-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">호국</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">과 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">안보</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">를 소재로 한 국민 참여위주의 미술 공모전을 통해</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">'</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">예술을 통한 국민과 육군의 만남의 장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">' </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">마련하고자 아래와 같이 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">회 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">'</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">호국미술대전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">'</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">을 개최하니 관심 있는 학생들이 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">공모기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’14. 4. 15(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 8.8(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">참여대상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">전 국민</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">만 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">16</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">세 이상</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">장병 및 군무원 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -151pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 154.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" 